  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Report on agroforestry development in Ghana: A particpatory approach to progress</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This report is a scoping study into agroforesty challenges and opportunites in Ghana, conducted through focus group discussions and key informant interviews with diverse particpants as well as desk-based research. It aims to idenitify challenges and suggest how best to promote agroforestry in a way that meets the needs of different stakholders. The report will inform a multi-stakeholder activity on agorofrestry uptake.</narrative>
  </description>
